From 17027b26824e406479596299aaa37eedecaeafc5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DaffyDabz <daffydabz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 15:39:55 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 351/371] pirates: the fishing game no longer closes about 10 s
 after it stops its bubble effects; 7 fishing effects hand themselves back to
 their pool the game's own way (client patch 49, no DC change, no restart)

Fishing lane's in-game run (15:23) closed with AttributeError 'checkInEffect' about 10 s after the fishing game stopped
its bubble effects. The 7 POR-ported effects (FishIdleBubbleEffect, FishBitingBubbleEffect,
FishFightingHookedBubbleEffect, LureHittingWaterBubbleEffect, SeaBottomBubbleEffect, LightRay, LureGlow) ended
cleanUpEffect with self.checkInEffect(self), which this game's PooledEffect does not have. They now use the game's
own idiom: if self.pool and self.pool.isUsed(self): self.pool.checkin(self). Lane test on the client's Panda
(test_fishing_client_win.py): live play folder 14 FAILURES, this tree 0 (106 PASS). The server never runs these
files; this keeps /opt equal to the client copy.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 pirates/effects/FishBitingBubbleEffect.py         | 3 ++-
 pirates/effects/FishFightingHookedBubbleEffect.py | 3 ++-
 pirates/effects/FishIdleBubbleEffect.py           | 3 ++-
 pirates/effects/LightRay.py                       | 3 ++-
 pirates/effects/LureGlow.py                       | 3 ++-
 pirates/effects/LureHittingWaterBubbleEffect.py   | 3 ++-
 pirates/effects/SeaBottomBubbleEffect.py          | 3 ++-
 7 files changed, 14 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/pirates/effects/FishBitingBubbleEffect.py b/pirates/effects/FishBitingBubbleEffect.py
index cb25062..3da9505 100644
--- a/pirates/effects/FishBitingBubbleEffect.py
+++ b/pirates/effects/FishBitingBubbleEffect.py
@@ -102,7 +102,8 @@ class FishBitingBubbleEffect(PooledEffect, EffectController):
 
     def cleanUpEffect(self):
         EffectController.cleanUpEffect(self)
-        self.checkInEffect(self)
+        if self.pool and self.pool.isUsed(self):
+            self.pool.checkin(self)
 
     def destroy(self):
         EffectController.destroy(self)
